From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:25:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1534/3799] soh: rename D_80A7847C -> sAxeQuadOffsets

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the four local-space corners of the axe's quad collider, transformed by the limb matrix each frame; the first two are also the tip and base of the blade trail.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Ik/z_en_ik.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Ik/z_en_ik.c | 15 ++++++++-------
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Ik/z_en_ik.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Ik/z_en_ik.c
index 475b49549..af94e094f 100644
